("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_CITY_NAME_BAIA_DE_ARAMA", "巴亚德阿拉默"),
("en_US", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III", "Your reputation precedes you, Vlad Țepeș, fearsome Voivode of Wallachia. While the shadows of stricken foes dance upon the scorched earth beneath the pikes, the long night awaits those who dare cross you. Lead your Călăraşi head first into the darkness, induce panic, and show the world just how fragile loyalty can be as word of your cruel victories reaches those in your path."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III", "瓦拉几亚可怕的大公弗拉德·采佩什，你的名声远扬。当受难的敌人的阴影在长矛下的焦土上跳舞时，长夜等待着那些敢于激怒你的人。带领你的卡拉拉西冲入的黑暗制造恐慌，并向这个世界展示，脆弱的忠诚在你残酷的胜利面前不堪一击。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "Halt, stranger. Know that you stand in the court House Drăculești. I am Vlad, son of the dragon, Prince to Wallachia. What I am to you entirely depends on how you conduct yourself."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "停下, 陌生人。要知道你站在德拉库勒斯蒂的宫廷。我是弗拉德， 龙之子， 瓦拉几亚的大公。 我怎么对你完全取决于你自己的表现。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "I extend an invitation to you representatives to visit my court, if you wish to see magnificence. It isn't far from here."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "我向你的这些代表发出邀请，如果他们愿意看到宏伟的景色，可以参观我的宫廷。它离这里并不遥远。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "I am glad to hear it."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "我很高兴听到这个消息。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "If we are to stand on good terms, we ought to exchange information on our capitals in which to conduct our meetings, wouldn't you agree?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "如果我们要保持良好的关系，我们应该交换关于我们的首都的信息，以便在其中进行会议，你同意吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "It has been too long. Have you business with me?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "已经过了很长时间了，你找我有事吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "Speak."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "说吧。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "Your delegation is welcome into my lands, and shall be granted the utmost respect - so long as they conduct themselves properly."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "我们欢迎你的代表团进入我的土地，并将给予他们最大的尊重——只要他们行为得当。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "That would be ill-advised at this time. For the good of Wallachia, I cannot accept."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "这是不明智的。为了瓦拉几亚的利益，我不能接受。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "I would like to offer you a delegation from my capital, carrying with it simple gifts of Plums, Frgál, and brandy. I trust you will accept them."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "我想向您提供一个来自我国首都的代表团，它携带着李子、弗尔加尔派和白兰地等简单的礼物。我相信你会接受它们。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "You pose no threat to my people or rule, so I shall grant this request."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "[NEWLINE]你对我的人民和统治不构成威胁，所以我将批准这一请求。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "Wallachia shall not bid welcome to outsiders."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "瓦拉几亚不欢迎外人的到来。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "I see little gain in our borders remaining closed to one another. Allow my troops to pass unimpeded through your lands, and you shall have my thanks."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "我认为我们的边界仍然相互封闭的话没有什么好处。请允许我的军队畅通无阻地通过你们的土地，我将向你们表示感谢。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "Indeed, you are a proven and trustworthy friend to my kingdom. I stand by you, pikes at the ready."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "的确，你是我的王国的一个公认的、值得信赖的朋友。我站在你身边，我已经准备好了长矛与你一同作战。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "Do not presume I am so easily won over."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "不要以为我是那么容易被征服的。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "The world is harsh, and many in our lands know this truth. It would be an honour for one as trusted as you to stand by my side as friend of Wallachia and its people."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "世界是残酷的，在我们的土地上有许多人知道这个事实。像你这样受人信任的人能够作为瓦拉几亚及其人民的朋友站在我身边，将是一种荣誉。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "Thank you for agreeing. May this friendship last through the era and beyond."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "谢谢你的同意。愿这段友谊在时代更迭中存续。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "Disappointing."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "遗憾。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "We have long found agreement in our affairs. Let us show the world that the blood between our nations runs thicker than most, with an alliance to strengthen ourselves against all foes. What do you say?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "我们早已在我们的事务中找到了共识。让我们向世界表明，我们国家之间的关系比大多数人都要深厚，通过结盟，我们能加抵抗对所有敌人的能力。你怎么说？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "I always have respect for those familiar with scorched earth tactics, so long as that earth does not belong to me."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "我总是尊重那些熟悉焦土战术的人，只要那片土地不属于我。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "So few troops with which to defend yourselves. I see weakness in your rule."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "你可供保卫自己的军队如此之少。我看到了你的统治中的弱点。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "The presence of your army at my borders is sowing rumours of war among my people. Remove them at once, before my hands are forced."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "你的军队出现在我的边界，在我的人民中播下了战争的谣言。在我被迫动手之前，请立即撤走他们。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "You do not intimidate me with such displays of aggression at my border. Move them now, or I shall move them for you."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "你不要在我的边界用这种侵略性的表现来恐吓我。现在就把它们移走，否则我将为移走它们。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "My apologies. It is merely a series of military exercises, for Wallachia will not remain undefended. I will let the generals know that they should move along."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "我表示歉意。这只是一系列的军事演习，因为瓦拉几亚不会一直不防守。我会让将军们知道，他们应该离开。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "My military acts in the interests of my nation. I shall remove them, but know that we do not take to your meddling lightly."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "我的军队为我的国家利益行事。我将把他们移走，但要知道，我们不会轻易接受你的干涉。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "Their positioning is no coincidence, for I intend to take your lands, and with them your head."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "他们的位置不是巧合，因为我打算夺取你的土地，以及你的首级。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "You have settled too close to my people's lands. Refrain from doing this again.."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "你们在离我的人民的土地太近的地方定居。请不要再这样做了。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "The lands you just claimed belong to Wallachia. Insolence will not be tolerated."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "你刚刚宣称的土地属于瓦拉几亚。这种傲慢无礼是无法容忍的。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "I was unaware that you laid claim to such lands. Rest assured, I shall find other, better lands to build upon elsewhere."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "我不知道你对这片土地有宣称。请放心，我将在其他地方找到其他更好的土地来建设。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "Oh? This land is yours? My apologies, I mistook it for barbarian territory. But if you insist, then I shall settle elsewhere next time."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "哦，这片土地是你的？我很抱歉，我把它误认为是野蛮人的领土。但如果你坚持的话，那么我下次会在其他地方定居。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "There is no need to be hasty, we are able to peacefully coexist in close proximity."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "没有必要急于求成，我们能够在近距离内和平共处。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "If you want this land, come and take it.."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "如果你想要这块土地，就来拿吧。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "Very well."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "很好。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "This will have to suffice."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "这就够了。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "You can do better than this."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_HAPPY", "你可以做得比这更好。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "The next words that leave your mouth had better be worth my time, or I shall cut out your tongue."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_UNHAPPY", "离开你的嘴的下一句话最好别浪费我的时间，否则我将割掉你的舌头。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "To openly declare yourself an enemy to the son of the dragon is not wise. Know that I shall spare no effort when seeking retribution."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "公开宣布自己与龙之子为敌是不明智的。你要知道，我将不遗余力地寻求报复。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "In your future I see a landscape of fire and death. I fear for your people. (Denounces You)"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "我看到的你们的未来是一片火光和死亡。我为你的人民担忧。(谴责你)"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "May your gods offer you salvation, for you shall find none by my hand."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "愿你们的神明给你们救赎，因为你们在我手中不会有任何救赎。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "As my banners cross the escarpments of Wallachia to find you, your people will look toward their commanders for guidance and see hope... I'll take that from them first."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "当我的行伍约过瓦拉几亚边界前往你的领地时，你的人民会向他们的统治者寻求希望……而我能摧毁这一切希望。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "The terms are acceptable."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "这些条款是可以接受的。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "The world is not big enough to hide from me."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "这个世界不够大，你无法躲避我。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "No good will come from overextending. Let us put an end to this war."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "过度扩张不会带来任何好处。让我们结束这场战争"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "If you truly believe Wallachia and its people will ever be yours, then you are the greatest fool I have ever known. Mark my words - even if I should fall, the dragon lives on in its people and Wallachia will rise again!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_ANY", "如果你真的以为瓦拉几亚和它的人民将永远属于你，那么你就是最大的傻瓜。记住我的话——即使我倒下了，龙之子也在他的人民中活着，瓦拉几亚将再次崛起！"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_VLAD_III_QUOTE", "It would be better that those who think of death should not follow me."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_VLAD_III_QUOTE", "怕死的别跟着我。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_VLAD_III_TITLE", "Vlad Țepeș"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_VLAD_III_TITLE", "弗拉德·采佩什"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_VLAD_III_SUBTITLE", "Voivode of Wallachia"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_VLAD_III_SUBTITLE", "瓦拉几亚大公"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_CAPSULE_BODY", "Vlad has the power to induce panic in the cities of his enemies on his quest for domination."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_CAPSULE_BODY", "弗拉德有能力在他寻求统治的过程中诱发敌人城市的恐慌。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_DETAILED_BODY", "While Romania's bonuses lend themselves well to diplomatic victories and cultural progression, Vlad will instead look to exploit the war-based bonuses to conquer. With the ability to flip nearby cities upon capturing another, enemies of Vlad will soon find that they are fighting battles on multiple fronts when their cities revolt. Vlad will look to incite chaos wherever he goes, and nothing epitomises this more than his ability to scorch the earth and damage adjacent enemy units when he pillages a tile in enemy territory. With Romania's bonuses for participating in emergencies, Vlad will no doubt find himself the target of many, but Vlad has a strong weapon with his unique horse archer that may move after attacking with which to help him secure a victory, after which he will only become stronger."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_DETAILED_BODY", "虽然罗马尼亚的能力很适合于外交胜利和文化进步，但弗拉德却希望利用基于战争的收益来征服。弗拉德的敌人能够在占领另一个城市后颠覆附近的城市，他们很快就会发现，当他们的城市发生叛乱时，他们会在多条战线上作战。弗拉德将寻求在他所到之处煽动混乱，没有什么比他在敌方领土上掠夺时烧毁土地和损害邻近敌方单位的能力更能体现这一点了。由于罗马尼亚对参与紧急情况的奖励，弗拉德无疑会发现自己是许多人的目标，但弗拉德有一个强大的武器，他独特的马匹弓箭手可以在攻击后移动，以帮助他确保胜利，之后他只会变得更强大。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "Vlad the Impaler, in full Vlad III Dracula or Romanian Vlad III Drăculea, also called Vlad III or Romanian Vlad Țepeș, (born 1431, Sighișoara, Transylvania [now in Romania]—died 1476, north of present-day Bucharest, Romania), voivode (military governor, or prince) of Walachia (1448; 1456–1462; 1476) whose cruel methods of punishing his enemies gained notoriety in 15th-century Europe."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "穿刺者弗拉德，全名弗拉德三世-德库拉或罗马尼亚语弗拉德三世-德拉库勒斯蒂，又称弗拉德三世或罗马尼亚语弗拉德·采佩什，（1431年生于特兰西瓦尼亚[现属罗马尼亚]的锡吉什瓦拉-1476年卒于今罗马尼亚布加勒斯特北部），瓦拉吉亚的世袭总督（军事总督，或亲王），他用残酷的方法惩罚敌人，在15世纪的欧洲声名鹊起。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "Vlad was the second of four brothers born into the noble family of Vlad II Dracul. His sobriquet Dracula (meaning ‘son of Dracul’) was derived from the Latin draco (‘dragon’) after his father’s induction into the Order of the Dragon, created by Holy Roman Emperor Sigismund for the defense of Christian Europe against the Ottoman Empire. Vlad moved to Târgoviște, Walachia, in 1436 when his father assumed leadership of the Walachian voivodate (principality). In 1442 Vlad and his younger brother were sent to the court of Ottoman Sultan Murad II as collateral to assure the sultan that their father, in a reversal of his previous position, would support Ottoman policies. Vlad returned in 1448, having been informed of the assassination of his father and older brother at the hands of Walachian boyars (nobles) the year before."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "弗拉德是出生在弗拉德二世-德拉库勒斯蒂贵族家庭的四个兄弟中的第二个。他的绰号Dracula（意为“Dracul之子”）来自拉丁文draco（“龙”），因为他的父亲入选了神圣罗马帝国皇帝西吉斯蒙德为保卫基督教欧洲不受奥斯曼帝国侵扰而创建的龙骑士团。1436年，弗拉德搬到了瓦拉几亚的塔尔戈维（Târgoviște），当时他的父亲担任了瓦拉几亚省（公国）的领导。1442年，弗拉德和他的弟弟被派往奥斯曼帝国苏丹穆拉德二世的宫廷，作为担保人，向苏丹保证他们的父亲一反以前的立场，支持奥斯曼帝国的政策。弗拉德于1448年返回，他被告知他的父亲和哥哥在前一年被瓦拉几（贵族）暗杀了。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_3", "Vlad then embarked upon the first of a lifelong series of campaigns to regain his father’s seat. His opponents included the boyars as well as his younger brother, who was supported by the Ottoman sultan. He emerged briefly victorious in 1448 but was deposed after only two months. After an eight-year struggle, Vlad again claimed the voivodate."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_3", "然后，弗拉德开始了他一生中一系列政治行动中的第一个，重新获得他父亲的王位。他的对手包括男孩和他的弟弟，后者得到了奥斯曼苏丹的支持。1448年，他取得了短暂的胜利，但仅仅两个月后就被废黜了。经过八年的斗争，弗拉德再次要求获得世袭总督地位。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_4", "It was during this period of rule that he committed the atrocities for which he was best known. His penchant for impaling his enemies on stakes in the ground and leaving them to die earned him the name Vlad the Impaler (Romanian: Vlad Țepeș). He inflicted this type of torture on foreign and domestic enemies alike: notably, as he retreated from a battle in 1462, he left a field filled with thousands of impaled victims as a deterrent to pursuing Ottoman forces. That year he escaped Ottoman capture only to be intercepted by Hungarian forces and imprisoned by Matthias I of Hungary. Vlad regained his seat in 1476 but was killed in battle the same year. He remained a folk hero in the region for his efforts against Ottoman encroachment."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_VLAD_III_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_4", "正是在这一统治时期，他犯下了最著名的暴行。他喜欢把敌人钉在地上的木桩上，任其自生自灭，因此被称为穿刺者弗拉德（罗马尼亚语：Vlad Țepeș）。他对外国和国内的敌人都施以这种酷刑：特别是在1462年，当他从一场战斗中撤退时，他留下了一块布满成千上万被刺穿的受害者的场地，作为对追击的奥斯曼军队的威慑。这一年，他逃脱了奥斯曼帝国的追捕，却被匈牙利军队拦截，并被匈牙利的马加什一世囚禁。弗拉德在1476年重新获得了他的席地位，但同年在战斗中丧生。由于他反对奥斯曼帝国的侵略，他仍然是该地区的民族英雄。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_UNITS_PAGE_UNIT_CVS_VLAD_III_UU_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "In the Middle Ages and early Renaissance, the Wallachians relied on light cavalry archers (Călăraşi) to deploy hit-and-run tactics. A core component of Vlad's army, Călăraşi were lightly armed missile troops typically used in skirmishes, capable of moving swiftly to avoid close combat or to deliver a rapid blow to the flanks or rear of its foe."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_UNITS_PAGE_UNIT_CVS_VLAD_III_UU_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "在中世纪和文艺复兴早期，瓦拉几人依靠轻骑兵弓箭手（卡拉拉西）来部署打了就跑的战术。作为弗拉德军队的核心组成部分，卡拉拉西是轻型武装的投射部队，通常用于小规模冲突，能够迅速移动以避免近身战斗，或对敌人的侧翼或后方进行快速打击。"),
