("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_NAME", "Arcana Historia"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_NAME", "秘史"),
("en_US", "LOC_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA", "Theodora"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA", "狄奥多拉"),
("en_US", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA", "All hail the most magnificent and magnanimous Empress Theodora, beloved of Byzantium and of Rome! From the lowly ranks of actress and courtesan you became the most powerful woman in the Roman Empire, consort to Justinian I. Starting in the late 520's AD, you joined your husband in a series of important spiritual and legal reforms, creating many laws which elevated the status of and promoted equal treatment of women in the empire. You also aided in the restoration and construction of many aqueducts, bridges and churches across Constantinople, culminating in the creation of the Hagia Sophia, one of the most splendid architectural wonders of the world. Beautiful Empress, Byzantium is in need of your wisdom and strength - her people are lost without your light to lead them. The Byzantine Empire may have fallen once, but its spirit is still intact waiting to be reborn anew. Can you return Byzantium to the heights of glory it once enjoyed? Can you create a civilization to stand the test of time?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA", "万岁，最伟大、最宽宏大量的狄奥多拉女皇！您是拜占庭和罗马的宠儿。您从一个卑微的女演员和宫女成为罗马帝国最强大的女人，成为查士丁尼一的妃子。从公元520年代末开始，你们一起进行了一系列重要的精神和法律改革，制定了许多法律。您还协助修复和建造了君士坦丁堡的许多水渠、桥梁和教堂，最终建成了圣索菲亚大教堂，这是世界上最辉煌的建筑奇迹之一。美丽的皇后，罗马需要你的智慧和力量——没有你的光芒引领，她的人民可能会迷失方向。罗马帝国可能已经衰落过一次，但它的精神仍然完好无损，等待着重新获得新生。你能让罗马回到它曾经享有的荣耀高度吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_TITLE", "Theodora"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_TITLE", "狄奥多拉"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_SUBTITLE", "Empress"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_SUBTITLE", "女皇"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_QUOTE", "The throne is a glorious sepulcher."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_QUOTE", "宝座就像是一个荣耀的墓穴。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "Theodora, wife of Justinian I and Empress of the Byzantine Empire, ruled one of history's preeminent empires during the 1st millennium AD. Known today as the most influential woman of the Byzantine Empire, Emperor Justinian named Theodora co-ruler of the empire, trusting in her wise counsel to guide his reign. Rising from humble beginnings, Theodora would become known throughout the empire - and history - as a tactful, trusted advisor to her emperor. She would be so crucial to the progress of the empire that some think it was Theodora, not Emperor Justinian, who truly guided the people of Byzantium during her lifetime. Most of our knowledge of Theodora comes from the writings of noted Byzantine historian Procopius of Caesarea, who extensively documented the life and times of the Byzantine Empire during Theodora's reign in the 6th century. Theodora's early life as we know it was a colorful one, her father having been a bear-keeper at the Hippodrome, her mother an acrobat. Said to have had exceptional intelligence and wit, Theodora supported herself independently as an actress for some time before catching the eye of Justinian, then heir to the throne of his uncle, Justin I. As mistress to Justinian, Theodora's beauty and intelligence made such an impression that he elevated her to the rank of patrician, where she joined the aristocratic families of the empire. Although Byzantine law prevented members of the government from marrying entertainers such as Theodora, Justinian's devotion to her was apparently enough that he had the law repealed. In 525, Justinian and Theodora were married, and shortly after his ascension to the throne as Emperor in 527, Theodora became 'Augusta,' or Empress of the Byzantine Empire. Theodora was no ordinary consort to the Emperor; Justinian ensured that she was named co-ruler, an important distinction that provided her with a much greater role in political affairs. During her reign, she was influential in the institution of numerous progressive (even by modern standards) policies. Theodora is credited with pressing Justinian to increase the rights of women within the empire, not only expanding their right to property ownership, but also reforming divorce laws that previously favored men. Theodora was what is known as a 'Monophysite Christian,' meaning she believed that Jesus Christ was an entirely divine being, unlike the more prevalent Orthodox belief that Jesus had a dual nature (divine yet with an earthly body). This ideology was highly controversial at the time, and considered divisive and heretical by many members of the Orthodox Church. Despite Justinian's Orthodox beliefs, Theodora maintained her own independence as a Monophysite, and even sheltered the Monophysite leaders who were often oppressed by the Orthodox majority. Theodora is also known to have founded a Monophysite monastery in the city of Sycae near Constantinople. The fortitude of Theodora and Justinian would be tested during the Nika Revolt, an uprising led by two opposing political factions (the Greens and the Blues), who attempted to install a rival Emperor to usurp Justinian's power. As the story goes, Justinian's natural instinct was to flee the city, but Theodora encouraged him to stand fast. Imploring Justinian to remain in the city, Theodora argued that it was better to die as an Emperor than as a fugitive. Believing in the wisdom of Theodora's words, Justinian remained in Constantinople and ordered his most loyal general, Flavius Belisarius, to attack the rebels. Herding the dissidents into the Hippodrome, Belisarius and his men annihilated them, brutally killing thousands, and quashing the rebellion. Empress Theodora left an indelible mark on history as one of the most powerful women of her era. It's clear that her influence affected many of the decisions put forth by her husband and, many historians agree, had it not been for Theodora's wise counsel during the Nika Revolt, Justinian's rule as Emperor would likely have ended, and the integrity of the empire itself would have been at risk."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "狄奥多拉是查士丁尼一世的妻子和东罗马帝国的皇后，在公元一千年期间统治着历史上最杰出的帝国之一。今天被称为东罗马帝国最有影响力的女性，查士丁尼皇帝任命狄奥多拉为帝国的共同统治者，相信她的明智建议可以指导他的统治。狄奥多拉从卑微的起点站起来，成为整个帝国——以及历史上——著名的机智、值得信赖的皇帝的顾问。她对帝国的发展至关重要，以至于有人认为那个时期真正指导拜占庭人民的是狄奥多拉，而不是查士丁尼皇帝。我们对狄奥多拉的了解大多来自于著名的拜占庭历史学家普罗科皮乌斯的著作，他广泛地记录了狄奥多拉在6世纪统治时期拜占庭帝国的生活和时代。据我们所知，狄奥多拉的早期生活是丰富多彩的，她的父亲是赛马场的养熊人，她的母亲是杂技演员。据说狄奥多拉有非凡的智慧和机智，在吸引查士丁尼的注意之前，她曾以演员的身份独立支撑了一段时间，当时他的叔叔查士丁尼一世的王位继承人。尽管拜占庭法律禁止政府成员与狄奥多拉这样的艺人结婚，但查士丁尼对她的奉献显然足以让他废除这项法律。525年，查士丁尼和狄奥多拉结婚，在他于527年登基为皇帝后不久，狄奥多拉成为 “奥古斯塔”，即拜占庭帝国的皇后。狄奥多拉不是皇帝的普通妃子；查士丁尼确保她被任命为共同统治者，这一重要区别为她在政治事务中提供了更大的作用。在她的统治期间，她对许多进步的（甚至是现代标准的）政策的制定产生了影响。狄奥多拉被认为是向查士丁尼施压，以增加帝国内妇女的权利，不仅扩大了她们的财产所有权，而且还改革了以前有利于男性的离婚法。狄奥多拉是所谓的 “基督一性”基督徒，这意味着她相信耶稣基督是完全神圣的存在，而不像更普遍的东正教信仰那样，认为耶稣具有双重性质（有神性又有人性）。这种意识形态在当时是非常有争议的，被许多东正教成员认为是异端。尽管查士丁尼有东正教信仰，但狄奥多拉还是保持了自己作为一神论者的独立性，甚至还庇护了经常受到东正教多数人压迫的一神论者领袖。众所周知，狄奥多拉还在君士坦丁堡附近的西凯城建立了一座基督一性修道院。狄奥多拉和查士丁尼的毅力将在尼卡起义中受到考验，这次起义由两个对立的政治派别（绿党和蓝党）领导，他们试图拥立一个皇帝来篡夺查士丁尼的权力。正如故事所言，查士丁尼的本能是逃离城市，但狄奥多拉鼓励他坚持下去。狄奥多拉恳求查士丁尼留在城里，她认为作为一个皇帝死了总比作为一个逃亡者好。查士丁尼相信狄奥多拉的话是明智的，他留在君士坦丁堡，并命令他最忠诚的将军弗拉维·贝利萨留攻击叛军。贝利萨留和他的部下将持不同政见者赶到赛马场，歼灭了他们，残酷地杀了数千人，平息了叛乱。狄奥多拉皇后作为她那个时代最强大的女性之一在历史上留下了不可磨灭的印记。很明显，她的影响力影响了她丈夫提出的许多决定，而且，许多历史学家都认为，如果不是狄奥多拉在尼卡起义期间的明智建议，查士丁尼作为皇帝的统治很可能已经结束，帝国本身的完整性也会受到威胁。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "My, isn't this a pleasant surprise - what may I call you, oh mysterious stranger? I am Theodora, beloved of Byzantium."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "遇到你真是一个惊喜吗——我可以叫你什么，神秘的陌生人？我是狄奥多拉，拜占庭的宠儿。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Melima, it's hot all of a sudden, don't you think?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "亲爱的，突然间很热，你不觉得吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Thank you. You are too kind!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "谢谢，你真是慷慨。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Where do you stand on the map?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "你在地图上的何处？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Khaiire! (Greetings)."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "你好！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "I accept your delegation with great pleasure."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "我将怀着极大的喜悦接受您的代表团。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Unfortunately, no."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "很不幸，不行"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "I will send you a convoy that will bring you specialties like these sweet honey cakes. Enjoy!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "我将派一个车队给你带来各种特产，比如甜美的蜂蜜蛋糕。好好享受吧!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "So be it."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "那就这样吧。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "It's unfortunate."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "真不幸。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "I believe it's in our mutual interest to allow free passage between our two great empires."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "我相信，允许我们两个伟大的帝国之间自由通行，符合我们的共同利益。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Of course, I accept your friendship!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "当然，我接受你的友谊!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "There is a misunderstanding, I do not wish to deepen our relationship."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "这是个误会，我无意深化我们之间的关系。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Do you want to be my friend?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "你想成为我的朋友吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Perfect!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "很好！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Definitely not."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "当然不行。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Would you like to form an alliance?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "你希望建立一个同盟吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Melima! It's always a pleasure to meet you."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "亲爱的! 见到你总是很高兴。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Excuse me?!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "你确定？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Immediately remove these troops from our borders otherwise I could not guarantee the safety of your soldiers."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "立即将这些部队撤出我们的边界，否则我无法保证你们士兵的安全。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "{LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY}"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", ""),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "{LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY}"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", ""),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Your behavior is abject."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "你的行为很卑鄙。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "The other players are all very aware of your coarse behavior.(Denounces You)."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "其他领袖都很清楚你的粗鄙行为。（谴责你）。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Now darling, tantrums are most unbecoming. I shall have to teach you a lesson."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "亲爱的，现在发脾气是不合适。我将不得不给你一个教训。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "It is always a shame to destroy a thing of beauty. Happily, you are not one."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "毁掉一件美丽的东西总是令人羞愧的。令人高兴的是，你不是这样的东西。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "I agree, let's make peace!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "我同意，让我们和平共处吧!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "There can be no peace for now."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "暂时不能有和平。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "I propose you to make peace."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "我建议你讲和。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "Like a child playing with toys you are. My people will never love you, nor suffer this indignation gracefully."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "你就像一个玩玩具的孩子。我的人民永远不会爱你，也不会毫无怨言的承受这种苦难。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", "[LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY]"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_THEODORA_ANY", ""),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_THEODORA_NAME", "Protection of monophysites"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_THEODORA_NAME", "一性论派"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_THEODORA_DESCRIPTION", "Try to generate as much faith as possible, and likes civilizations that have already adopted her religion."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_THEODORA_DESCRIPTION", "尽量产生尽可能多的信仰，并喜欢那些已经采用她的宗教的文明。"),
("en_US", "LOC_IMPROVEMENT_GEDEMO_METANOIA_NAME", "Metanoia"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_IMPROVEMENT_GEDEMO_METANOIA_NAME", "忏悔室"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_IMPROVEMENTS_PAGE_IMPROVEMENT_GEDEMO_METANOIA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "Theodora intervened a lot to make Justinian take measures to protect prostitutes, courtesans and actresses. She bought prostitutes herself, founded a house for 'repentant sinners' and influenced the measures concerning women of the Justinian Code, such as the reduction of the penalty in cases of adultery."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_IMPROVEMENTS_PAGE_IMPROVEMENT_GEDEMO_METANOIA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "狄奥多拉进行了大量干预，使查士丁尼采取措施保护妓女、宫女和女演员。她亲自收买妓女，为 “忏悔的罪人 ”建立了一所房子，并影响了《查士丁尼法典》中有关妇女的措施，如减少通奸案件的处罚。");
*/
-- Charlemagne
insert or replace into LocalizedText (Language, Tag, Text) values
("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_NAME", "Carolingian Renaissance"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_NAME", "加洛林文艺复兴"),
("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_DESCRIPTION", "[ICON_DISTRICT_HOLYSITE] Holy Site district buildings provide [ICON_Gold] Gold equivalent to their [ICON_Faith] Faith output. Charlemagne can build the Paladin Unique Unit."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_DESCRIPTION", "圣地相邻也获得金币。研究马镫以后，获得特色单位圣骑士。"),
("en_US", "LOC_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1", "Charlemagne"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1", "查理曼"),
("en_US", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1", "O Great Charlemagne! You are the most famous sovereign of the Middle Ages. King of the Franks and emperor of the West, great conqueror and skillful administrator, he gave his name to a dynasty, that of the Carolingians. His empire was so vast that it appears in the history books of several countries of western Europe, including France and Germany.[NewLine]Can you build a civilization that will stand the test of time?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1", "查理大帝啊！您是中世纪最有名的君主，是法兰克人的国王和罗马人的皇帝，伟大的征服者和熟练的管理者。您以自己的姓氏命名了一个王朝，那就是加洛林王朝。您的帝国如此之大，深远地影响了德国、法国和意大利。现在带领您的圣骑士谱写史诗，延续《查理大帝传》中的伟业吧。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_TITLE", "Charlemagne"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_TITLE", "查理曼"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_SUBTITLE", "Holy Roman Emperor"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_SUBTITLE", "神圣罗马皇帝"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_QUOTE", "You count on your birth and you conceive of pride! Know that you will have no government or bishoprics if you are not more educated than others."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_QUOTE", "你对自己的出身满怀骄傲，但是要知道，你像这样没有教养的话是保不住自己的地位的。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "Charlemagne belongs to the Carolingian dynasty. Son of Pepin the Short, he is king of the Franks from 768, becomes by conquest king of the Lombards in 774 and is crowned emperor in Rome by Pope Leo III on 24 or 25 December 800, recognizing a dignity that has disappeared since the deposition of the last Roman emperor of the West in 476. King warrior, he significantly enlarged his kingdom by a series of military campaigns, especially against the pagan Saxons whose submission was difficult and violent, but also against the Lombards in Italy and the Muslims of al-Andalus. Sovereign reformer, concerned with religious orthodoxy and culture, he protects the arts and letters and is at the origin of the 'Carolingian renaissance'. His immediate political work, the Empire, did not survive him for long. In accordance with the Germanic custom of inheritance, Charlemagne foresees from 806 the division of the Empire between his three sons. After many adventures, the Empire will finally be divided in 843 between three of his grandsons, during the Treaty of Verdun. The feudal fragmentation of the following centuries and the formation in Europe of the rival nation-states condemn to impotence those who explicitly attempt to restore the universal empire of Charlemagne, especially the rulers of the Holy Roman Empire, Otto I in 962 to Charles V in the sixteenth century, even Napoleon I, haunted by the example of the most eminent Carolingians."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "查理大帝属于加洛林王朝。他是矮子丕平之子，从768年起成为法兰克人的国王，774年通过征服成为伦巴第人的国王，并于800年12月24日或25日在罗马被教皇利奥三世加冕为皇帝，承认了自476年西方最后一位罗马皇帝被废黜后消失的帝位。查理大帝是个军事家，他通过一系列的军事行动大大地扩大了他的王国，特别是对异教的萨克森人，他们的臣服过程是血腥暴力的，意大利的伦巴第人和安达卢西亚的穆斯林也被查理曼如此征服。他也是改革者，关注宗教的正统性和文化，他保护艺术和文学，是 “加洛林文艺复兴” 的起源。他的直接政治遗产——法兰克帝国，并没有存在太久。根据日耳曼人的继承习俗，查理曼从806年开始就预见到了帝国在他的三个儿子之间分裂。经过多次曲折，帝国最终将在843年的凡尔登条约中被他的三个孙子瓜分。接下来几个世纪的封建分裂和欧洲敌对民族国家的形成，使那些明确试图恢复查理曼帝国的人无能为力，特别是神圣罗马帝国的统治者，从962年的奥托一世到16世纪的查理五世，甚至拿破仑一世，都没能超越最杰出的加洛林大帝的先例。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "The figure of Charlemagne was the subject of rifts in Europe, including political issues between the twelfth and nineteenth century between the Germanic nation that considers the Holy Roman Empire as the legitimate successor of the Carolingian emperor and the French nation which makes it a central element of the dynastic continuity of the Capetians. He is sometimes considered the 'Father of Europe' for bringing together a significant part of Western Europe, and laying down principles of government inherited from the great European states. The two main texts of the ninth century depicting the real Charlemagne, the Vita Caroli d'Enginhard and the Gesta Karoli Magni attributed to the monk of St. Gall Notker the Stammerer, the halo also legends and myths taken over the following centuries : 'There is the Charlemagne of the vassal and feudal society, the Charlemagne of the Crusade and the Reconquest, the Charlemagne inventor of the Crown of France or the Imperial Crown, the Charlemagne badly canonized but considered true saint of the Church, the Charlemagne of the good schoolchildren. 'Charlemagne is, by tolerance of Pope Benedict XIV, a blessed Catholic celebrated locally on January 28. In fact, in 1165, the Emperor Frederick I Barbarossa obtains the canonization of Charlemagne by the Antipope Pascal III Many dioceses in the North of France then inscribed Charlemagne on their calendar and in 1661 the University of Paris chose him as patron saint. the city of Aix-la-Chapelle venerates his relics. Yet the Catholic Church has removed from its calendar 'the emperor who converts the Saxons by the sword rather than by the peaceful preaching of the Gospel'"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "查理曼大帝的形象是欧洲分裂的主题，包括十二世纪和十九世纪之间的政治问题，即认为神圣罗马帝国是卡洛林王朝皇帝合法继承人的日耳曼民族和将其作为卡佩王朝延续的核心要素的法兰西民族之间的问题。他有时被认为是 '欧洲之父'，因为他将西欧的很大一部分地区聚集在一起，并制定了从欧洲大国继承下来的政府原则。九世纪描述真实查理曼的两个主要文本，即《查理大帝传》（艾因哈德著）和《查理大帝传》（圣高尔修道院僧侣著）。在接下来的几个世纪里，查理曼大帝还被赋予了一些传说和神话的光环：“有附庸和封建社会的查理曼大帝，有十字军东征和重新征服的查理曼大帝，有法国王冠或帝国王冠的发明者查理曼大帝，有被严重加冕但被视为教会真正圣人的查理曼大帝，有好学生们的查理曼大帝。”根据教皇本笃十四世的宽容，查理曼是当地1月28日庆祝的受祝福的天主教徒。事实上，在1165年，皇帝腓特烈一世-巴巴罗萨获得了伪教皇帕斯卡尔三世对查理曼的册封。法国北部的许多教区随后将查理曼刻在他们的日历上，1661年，巴黎大学选择他为守护神。亚琛市崇敬他的遗物。然而，天主教会却从其日历中删除了 '这位用剑而不是用和平的福音传教来改变萨克森人的皇帝'。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Glory to you, friend! I am Charlemagne, Emperor of the Romans and stalwart defender of the Holy Kingdom of God. What light has beckoned you to me this day?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "荣耀归于您，朋友! 我是查理大帝，罗马人的皇帝，是的神圣王国的坚定捍卫者。今天是有什么福音是您要分享的？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Salutations, leader. I am Charlemagne, holy Emperor of the Romans and King of the Franks. Are you a pious ruler, as am I? Or at least, one worthy of my audience?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "向您致敬，领袖。我是查理大帝，罗马人的神圣皇帝和法兰克人的国王。你和我一样是个虔诚的统治者吗？或者至少是一个值得我觐见的人？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Well, I accept your invitation."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "好，我接受邀请。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "If you want it show me on the map where your capital is and I'll do the same."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "如果您想与我分享首都的地图，那我也会这么做。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Hey you look fit. Mass was good this morning?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "嘿，您看起来很健康。今天早上的弥撒不错吧？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Your delegation will be welcomed."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "欢迎您的代表团。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Your delegation will wait at the border."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "您的代表团最好还是在边境上等着。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "We offer you illuminations and religious icons, take care of them!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我们为您提供绘画和宗教图腾，请照顾好它们。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "It's OK, you can go!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "好吧，您请过。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "No, you will not pass!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "不，您还没有被允许入境。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "I have to go fight over your kingdom, will you let me go ?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我必须去争夺你的王国，你会让我去吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "I accept your friendship."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我接受您的友谊。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Certainly not!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "当然不行！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "I would like us to be friends."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我希望我们成为朋友。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "I accept your friendship."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我接受您的友谊。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "You will regret this affront!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "你将为这种愚行后悔！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Do you want to forge an alliance?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "您愿意与我结盟吗?"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "The best neighbors are distant ones. Right now, you are our empire's best neighbor."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "很好，我们两国的距离非常有利于我们的和平交往。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "There is no distance between our lands. My people are forced to endure the stench of your own."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "去听听萨克森人、伦巴第人、阿瓦尔人和安达卢斯人的历史吧！你想变的和他们一样吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "My spies told me about your troops gathering at my borders! Remove them before committing the irreparable!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我的密探告诉我，你们的军队在我的边界集结! 在犯下不可挽回的罪行之前把他们赶走!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "I'm tired of your traps!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我已经厌倦了你那些圈套！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "I'm tired of your traps!(Denounces You)."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我已经厌倦了你那些圈套！（谴责你）"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "It's time to incorporate your miserable state into my kingdom! this is a declaration of war."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我已经厌倦了你那些圈套！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "It's time to incorporate your miserable state into my kingdom! this is a declaration of war."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我已经厌倦了你那些圈套！（谴责你）"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Our kingdoms yearn for peace now."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我们的王国现在恳求一个和平的机会。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "We are not yet at the end of this conflict."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我们之间的冲突还远没有结束。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Let's make peace, our countries are bloodless"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "我们停止战争吧，不要再流血冲突了。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "Lay me to rest and watch the skies as God mourns my demise, for he shall strike a pestilence upon your victory, and one day I shall have my vengeance."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_ANY", "让我安息吧。当上帝哀悼我的死亡时，看看天空，因为他将对你的胜利降下一场瘟疫。有一天我将得到我的复仇。"),
("en_US", "LOC_UNIT_GEDEMO_GPALADIN_NAME", "Paladin"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_UNIT_GEDEMO_GPALADIN_NAME", "圣骑士"),
("en_US", "LOC_UNIT_GEDEMO_GPALADIN_DESCRIPTION", "Charlemagne's Unique Unit that replaces the Knight. Reduces the [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength of adjacent enemy units by 5, with the penalties being cumulative for enemies adjacent to multiple Paladins."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_UNIT_GEDEMO_GPALADIN_DESCRIPTION", "取代骑士的查理曼特色单位。相邻敌方单位-5[ICON_Strength] 战斗力，多个圣骑士的能力可以叠加。"),
("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_GEDEMO_GPALADIN_NAME", "Charlemagne Unique Unit: Paladin"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_GEDEMO_GPALADIN_NAME", "查理曼的特色单位：圣骑士"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_NAME", "Carolingian Marches"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_NAME", "加洛林征服"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_DESCRIPTION", "Dislikes civilizations that have cities close to his borders and will try to conquer them. Likes civilizations that are not his neighbors."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_KARLDERGROSSE1_DESCRIPTION", "不喜欢那些有城市靠近他的边界的文明，并会试图征服它们。喜欢不与他为邻的文明。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MARCHEN_NEIGHBOR", "The Leader is displeased that your Empire is near his."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MARCHEN_NEIGHBOR", "这位领袖对您的帝国离他太近很不满意。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MARCHEN_NOT_NEIGHBOR", "The Leader is pleased that your Empire is far from his."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MARCHEN_NOT_NEIGHBOR", "这位领袖对您的帝国远离他感到很满意。"),
("en_US", "LOC_CITY_NAME_TRIEL", "Triel"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_CITY_NAME_TRIEL", "特里尔"),
("en_US", "LOC_CITY_NAME_FRANKFURT", "Frankfurt"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_CITY_NAME_FRANKFURT", "法兰克福"),
("en_US", "LOC_CITY_NAME_KLON", "Cologne"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_CITY_NAME_KLON", "科隆"),
("en_US", "LOC_CITY_NAME_BERLIN", "Berlin"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_CITY_NAME_BERLIN", "柏林"),
("en_US", "LOC_CITY_NAME_KONIGSBERG", "Konigsberg"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_CITY_NAME_KONIGSBERG", "柯尼斯堡"),
("en_US", "LOC_CITY_NAME_MEINZ", "Meinz"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_CITY_NAME_MEINZ", "美因茨"),
