("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_NAME", "Carolingian Renaissance"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_NAME", "加洛林文艺复兴"),
("en_US", "LOC_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1", "Charlemagne"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1", "查理曼"),
("en_US", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1", "O Great Charlemagne! You are the most famous sovereign of the Middle Ages. King of the Franks and emperor of the West, great conqueror and skillful administrator, he gave his name to a dynasty, that of the Carolingians. His empire was so vast that it appears in the history books of several countries of western Europe, including France and Germany.[NewLine]Can you build a civilization that will stand the test of time?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1", "查理大帝啊！你是中世纪最有名的君主，是法兰克人的国王和西方的皇帝，伟大的征服者和熟练的管理者。你以自己的名字命名了一个王朝，那就是加洛林王朝。你的帝国是如此之大，出现在西欧好几个国家的历史书中，包括法国和德国。[NewLine]你能建立一个经得起时间考验的文明吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_TITLE", "Charlemagne"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_TITLE", "查理曼"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_SUBTITLE", "Holy Roman Emperor"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_SUBTITLE", "神圣罗马皇帝"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_QUOTE", "You count on your birth and you conceive of pride! Know that you will have no government or bishoprics if you are not more educated than others."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_QUOTE", "你对自己的出身满怀骄傲，但是要知道，你像这样没有教养的话是保不住自己的地位的。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "Charlemagne belongs to the Carolingian dynasty. Son of Pepin the Short, he is king of the Franks from 768, becomes by conquest king of the Lombards in 774 and is crowned emperor in Rome by Pope Leo III on 24 or 25 December 800, recognizing a dignity that has disappeared since the deposition of the last Roman emperor of the West in 476. King warrior, he significantly enlarged his kingdom by a series of military campaigns, especially against the pagan Saxons whose submission was difficult and violent, but also against the Lombards in Italy and the Muslims of al-Andalus. Sovereign reformer, concerned with religious orthodoxy and culture, he protects the arts and letters and is at the origin of the 'Carolingian renaissance'. His immediate political work, the Empire, did not survive him for long. In accordance with the Germanic custom of inheritance, Charlemagne foresees from 806 the division of the Empire between his three sons. After many adventures, the Empire will finally be divided in 843 between three of his grandsons, during the Treaty of Verdun. The feudal fragmentation of the following centuries and the formation in Europe of the rival nation-states condemn to impotence those who explicitly attempt to restore the universal empire of Charlemagne, especially the rulers of the Holy Roman Empire, Otto I in 962 to Charles V in the sixteenth century, even Napoleon I, haunted by the example of the most eminent Carolingians."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "查理大帝属于加洛林王朝。他是矮子丕平之子，从768年起成为法兰克人的国王，774年通过征服成为伦巴第人的国王，并于800年12月24日或25日在罗马被教皇利奥三世加冕为皇帝，承认了自476年西方最后一位罗马皇帝被废黜后消失的帝位。查理大帝是个军事家，他通过一系列的军事行动大大地扩大了他的王国，特别是对异教的萨克森人，他们的臣服过程是血腥暴力的，意大利的伦巴第人和安达卢西亚的穆斯林也被查理曼如此征服。他也是改革者，关注宗教的正统性和文化，他保护艺术和文学，是 '加洛林文艺复兴 '的起源。他的直接政治遗产——法兰克帝国，并没有存在太久。根据日耳曼人的继承习俗，查理曼从806年开始就预见到了帝国在他的三个儿子之间分裂。经过多次曲折，帝国最终将在843年的凡尔登条约中被他的三个孙子瓜分。接下来几个世纪的封建分裂和欧洲敌对民族国家的形成，使那些明确试图恢复查理曼帝国的人无能为力，特别是神圣罗马帝国的统治者，从962年的奥托一世到16世纪的查理五世，甚至拿破仑一世，都没能超越最杰出的加洛林大帝的先例。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "The figure of Charlemagne was the subject of rifts in Europe, including political issues between the twelfth and nineteenth century between the Germanic nation that considers the Holy Roman Empire as the legitimate successor of the Carolingian emperor and the French nation which makes it a central element of the dynastic continuity of the Capetians. He is sometimes considered the 'Father of Europe' for bringing together a significant part of Western Europe, and laying down principles of government inherited from the great European states. The two main texts of the ninth century depicting the real Charlemagne, the Vita Caroli d'Enginhard and the Gesta Karoli Magni attributed to the monk of St. Gall Notker the Stammerer, the halo also legends and myths taken over the following centuries : 'There is the Charlemagne of the vassal and feudal society, the Charlemagne of the Crusade and the Reconquest, the Charlemagne inventor of the Crown of France or the Imperial Crown, the Charlemagne badly canonized but considered true saint of the Church, the Charlemagne of the good schoolchildren. 'Charlemagne is, by tolerance of Pope Benedict XIV, a blessed Catholic celebrated locally on January 28. In fact, in 1165, the Emperor Frederick I Barbarossa obtains the canonization of Charlemagne by the Antipope Pascal III Many dioceses in the North of France then inscribed Charlemagne on their calendar and in 1661 the University of Paris chose him as patron saint. the city of Aix-la-Chapelle venerates his relics. Yet the Catholic Church has removed from its calendar 'the emperor who converts the Saxons by the sword rather than by the peaceful preaching of the Gospel'"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "查理曼大帝的形象是欧洲分裂的主题，包括十二世纪和十九世纪之间的政治问题，即认为神圣罗马帝国是卡洛林王朝皇帝合法继承人的日耳曼民族和将其作为卡佩王朝延续的核心要素的法兰西民族之间的问题。他有时被认为是 '欧洲之父'，因为他将西欧的很大一部分地区聚集在一起，并制定了从欧洲大国继承下来的政府原则。九世纪描述真实查理曼的两个主要文本，即《查理大帝传》（艾因哈德著）和《查理大帝传》（圣高尔修道院僧侣著）。在接下来的几个世纪里，查理曼大帝还被赋予了一些传说和神话的光环：'有附庸和封建社会的查理曼大帝，有十字军东征和重新征服的查理曼大帝，有法国王冠或帝国王冠的发明者查理曼大帝，有被严重加冕但被视为教会真正圣人的查理曼大帝，有好学生们的查理曼大帝。'根据教皇本笃十四世的宽容，查理曼是当地1月28日庆祝的受祝福的天主教徒。事实上，在1165年，皇帝腓特烈一世-巴巴罗萨获得了伪教皇帕斯卡尔三世对查理曼的册封。法国北部的许多教区随后将查理曼刻在他们的日历上，1661年，巴黎大学选择他为守护神。亚琛市崇敬他的遗物。然而，天主教会却从其日历中删除了 '这位用剑而不是用和平的福音传教来改变萨克森人的皇帝'。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Glory to you, friend! I am Charlemagne, Emperor of the Romans and stalwart defender of the Holy Kingdom of God. What light has beckoned you to me this day?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "荣耀归于您，朋友! 我是查理大帝，罗马人的皇帝，是神圣王国的坚定捍卫者。今天有什么福音是您要分享的？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Salutations, leader. I am Charlemagne, holy Emperor of the Romans and King of the Franks. Are you a pious ruler, as am I? Or at least, one worthy of my audience?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "向您致敬，领袖。我是查理大帝，罗马人的神圣皇帝和法兰克人的国王。你和我一样是个虔诚的统治者吗？或者至少是一个值得我觐见的人？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Well, I accept your invitation."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "好，我接受邀请。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "If you want it show me on the map where your capital is and I'll do the same."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "如果您想与我分享首都的地图，那我也会这么做。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Hey you look fit. Mass was good this morning?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "嘿，您看起来很健康。今天早上的弥撒不错吧？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Your delegation will be welcomed."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "欢迎您的代表团。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Your delegation will wait at the border."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "您的代表团最好还是在边境上等着"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "We offer you illuminations and religious icons, take care of them!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我们为您提供绘画和宗教图腾，请照顾好它们!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "It's OK, you can go!."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "好吧，您请过。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "No, you will not pass!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "不，您还没有被允许入境"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "I have to go fight over your kingdom, will you let me go ?!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我必须去争夺你的王国，你会让我去吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "I accept your friendship."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我接受您的友谊。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Certainly not!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "当然不行！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "I would like us to be friends."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我希望我们成为朋友。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "I accept your friendship."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我接受您的友谊"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "You will regret this affront!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "你将为这种愚行后悔！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Do you want to forge an alliance?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "您愿意与我结盟吗?"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "The best neighbors are distant ones. Right now, you are our empire's best neighbor."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "很好，我们两国的距离非常有利于我们的和平交往。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "There is no distance between our lands. My people are forced to endure the stench of your own."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "去听听萨克森人、伦巴第人、阿瓦尔人和安达卢斯人的历史吧！你想变的和他们一样吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "My spies told me about your troops gathering at my borders! Remove them before committing the irreparable!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我的密探告诉我，你们的军队在我的边界集结! 在犯下不可挽回的罪行之前把他们赶走!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "I'm tired of your traps!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我已经厌倦了你那些圈套！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "I'm tired of your traps!(Denounces You)."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我已经厌倦了你那些圈套！（谴责你）"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "It's time to incorporate your miserable state into my kingdom! this is a declaration of war."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "是时候把你那可憎的国家并入我的疆域了！这是宣战！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "It's time to incorporate your miserable state into my kingdom! this is a declaration of war."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "是时候把你那可憎的国家并入我的疆域了！这是宣战！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Our kingdoms yearn for peace now."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我们的王国现在恳求一个和平的机会。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "We are not yet at the end of this conflict."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我们之间的冲突还远没有结束。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Let's make peace, our countries are bloodless"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "我们停止战争吧，不要再流血冲突了。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "Lay me to rest and watch the skies as God mourns my demise, for he shall strike a pestilence upon your victory, and one day I shall have my vengeance."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_ANY", "让我安息吧。当上帝哀悼我的死亡时，看看天空，因为他将对你的胜利降下一场瘟疫。有一天我将得到我的复仇。"),
("en_US", "LOC_UNIT_GEDEMO_PALADIN_NAME", "Paladin"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_UNIT_GEDEMO_PALADIN_NAME", "圣骑士"),
("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_GEDEMO_PALADIN_NAME", "Charlemagne Unique Unit: Paladin"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_GEDEMO_PALADIN_NAME", "查理曼的特色单位：圣骑士"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_NAME", "Carolingian Marches"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_NAME", "加洛林征服"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_DESCRIPTION", "Dislikes civilizations that have cities close to his borders and will try to conquer them. Likes civilizations that are not his neighbors."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_CHARLEMAGNE1_DESCRIPTION", "不喜欢那些有城市靠近他的边界的文明，并会试图征服它们。喜欢不与他为邻的文明。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MARCHES_NEIGHBOR", "The Leader is displeased that your Empire is near his."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MARCHES_NEIGHBOR", "这位领袖对您的帝国离他太近很不满意。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MARCHES_NOT_NEIGHBOR", "The Leader is pleased that your Empire is far from his."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MARCHES_NOT_NEIGHBOR", "这位领袖对您的帝国远离他感到很满意。"),
