("en_US", "LOC_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA", "Nyatsimba Mutota"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA", "恩雅茨姆巴·穆托塔"),
("en_US", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA", "Prince Nyatsimba Mutota, around 1430, you travelled to the north of the region in search of salt. When the ancient Zimbabwe began its military and economic decline, some of the elite’s of the city migrated two hundred miles to the north to Zambezi River. As a result of their settlement, the Shona state of Monomotapa, commonly known Mutapa was established but it was short-lived. The ruler of this state was you, Mutota, and you were their first king. You gained control of the producing sites and a great portion of Zambezi Valley.[NewLine]Can you build now a civilization that will stand the test of time?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA", "恩雅茨姆巴·穆托塔王子，在古老的津巴布韦衰落之时，您没有陷于内耗之中，而是带领族人开拓未来。您带领精英到赞比西河以北去寻找新资源，建立了属于修纳人的莫诺莫塔帕王国，也就是众所周知的穆托塔，您就是他们的开国之君。您现在已经控制了赞比西河谷富饶的资源。[NewLine]您现在能建立一个经得起时间考验的文明吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_TITLE", "Nyatsimba Mutota"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_TITLE", "恩雅茨姆巴·穆托塔"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_SUBTITLE", "Mwene"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_SUBTITLE", "姆韦尼"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_QUOTE", "The old man gives the best advice."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_QUOTE", "需听老人言"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "The only information we have about Nyatsimba Mutota comes from oral tradition. It is recorded that the warrior prince named Nyatsimba Mutota from the Kingdom of Zimbabwe was sent to find new sources of salt in the north. Prince Mutota found his salt among the Tavara, a Shona subdivision, who were prominent elephant hunters. They were conquered and a capital was established 350 km north of Great Zimbabwe at Zvongombe by the Zambezi. With Mutota as ruler, the Kingdom outgrew its parent state and became the dominant force in the region, mainting nominal independence from the powerful Portugese colonialist in Mozambique. Mutota's empire remained until, in the 17th century, rivalry between the Portugese and the Rozwi Empire (heralding from the Zimbabwe Plateau where Mutota was born) ripped it apart."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "据记载，来自津巴布韦王国的名为恩雅茨姆巴·穆托塔的战士王子被派往北方寻找新的盐源。穆托塔王子在修纳人的分支塔瓦拉人中找到了盐，他们是著名的猎象者。他们被征服了，并在大津巴布韦以北350公里处的赞比西河边的兹冯贡贝建立了首都。在穆托塔的统治下，该王国超越了它的母国，成为该地区的主导力量，并在名义上独立于莫桑比克强大的葡萄牙殖民者。穆托塔的帝国一直保持到17世纪，葡萄牙人和罗兹维帝国（来自穆托塔起源的津巴布韦高原）之间的竞争将其撕碎。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Welcome! I am Nyatsimba Mutota, the prodigal Prince. How did you hear about Zimbabwe?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "欢迎！欢迎 我是浪子王子恩雅茨姆巴·穆托塔。你是怎么听说津巴布韦的？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "It is a pleasure to meet you. Come and have a seat!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "很高兴见到你。来吧，请坐!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "So be it."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "那就这样吧。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Welcome among us, tell us more about your capital!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "欢迎来到我们中间，请告诉我们更多关于你的首都的信息!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Dumilani (Greetings)!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "杜米拉尼！（你好！）"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "We welcome your delegation with joy!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "我们欢欣鼓舞地欢迎贵国代表团。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Not today."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "今天不行。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Gifts of Kapentas and Sadza are brought to you by my delegation. We offer them to you. Have a nice diner!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "我的代表团带给你的礼物是坦噶尼喀沙丁鱼和玉米粥。祝您用餐愉快!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "We have nothing to fear from your military. You may pass."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "我们对你们的军队没有什么可担心的。你可以通过。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "You may not pass through our lands. It is closed to you."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "你不能通过我们的土地。它对你们是关闭的。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Let us pass through your lands! We may be founding a new capital 300 kilometers north."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "让我们通过你们的土地! 我们可能会在北方三百里处建立一个新的首都。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Let's celebrate our friendship!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "让我们庆祝我们的友谊！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "No, sorry!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "不行，抱歉。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Do you prefer vassalage or friendship?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "你是喜欢附庸关系还是友谊？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Thank you!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "谢谢。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Are you kidding?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "你在逗我吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Would you like to form an alliance with us?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "你愿意与我们结成联盟吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "You are actually worthy of interest, what chance to meet you!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "你真是值得关注的，有什么机会能见到你呢？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Your interest are conflicting with ours. Be careful."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "你的利益与我们的利益是冲突的。小心点。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "You cannot surprise the Great Mwene, you know?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "你不能让大姆韦尼感到惊讶，你知道吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "I will tell the truth to the other leaders: you worry us."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "我将对其他领导人说实话：你让我们很担忧。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "You are a sore! (Denounces You)."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "你是个疮疤! (谴责你）"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "We can read on your mausoleum that you were daring, or rather that you had gone mad at the end..."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "我们可以在你的墓志铭上读到，你是大胆的，但你在最后已经疯了......"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Well, we need land, and yours are there, waiting to be picked."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "好吧，我们需要土地，而你的土地就在那里，等着我们去收割。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "So let's make peace."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "所以让我们和平相处吧。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "I do not accept."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "我不能接受。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Can we stop this childishness and talk about business?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "我们能停止这些儿戏并谈谈生意吗"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "Ophir has crumbled. The Zimbabwe birds have all left their roost. When you kill me, you will have destroyed all that remains of my people!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_ANY", "俄斐已经崩溃了。津巴布韦的鸟儿都已经离开了它们的巢穴。当你杀了我，你将会毁掉我的族人的一切！"),
("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_LTRAIT_NAME", "Rise of Mutapa"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_LTRAIT_NAME", "穆塔帕崛起"),
("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_GEDEMO_ZIMBABWE_CIV_TRAIT_NAME", "Journey beyond the Devasted Lands"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_GEDEMO_ZIMBABWE_CIV_TRAIT_NAME", "跨越废土之旅"),
("en_US", "LOC_UNIT_GEDEMO_ROZWI_NAME", "Uajero"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_UNIT_GEDEMO_ROZWI_NAME", "猎象人"),
("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_GEDEMO_ROZWI_NAME", "Zimbabwe Unique Unit : Uajero"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_UNIT_GEDEMO_ROZWI_NAME", "津巴布韦特色单位：猎象人"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_UNITS_PAGE_UNIT_GEDEMO_ROZWI_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "The history of this country is also obscure. We only know that one of the elephant hunters (Uajero), who came from Changoe under the leadership of a resolute black man named Mutota (from the family of Ghangamira), and attracted by the staves and the salt that had spread in the country Mutonga de Ghemida, named Netondo (the creditor of the white people of Te te), began the conquest of this great territory, without being able to complete it at the same time, because death removed their chief, at the top of the Serra Chitacoxangonha, near of this promised land."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_UNITS_PAGE_UNIT_GEDEMO_ROZWI_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "这个国家的历史也是模糊不清的。我们只知道其中一个猎象人（Uajero）从昌戈俄来到这里，在一个名叫穆托塔（来自刚加米拉家族）的坚决的黑人的领导下的国家，并在这个国家——葛米达的木通噶——被名为内通多的特特的白人放债人售卖的板条和盐吸引。他于是开始了对这块巨大土地的征服，但没有能够完成，因为死亡带走了他们的酋长。他被葬在这块应许之地附近的奇塔科沙贡哈山顶。"),
("en_US", "LOC_CIVILIZATION_GEDEMO_ZIMBABWE_DESCRIPTION_JFD_CIVILIZATION", "Zimbabwean Civilization"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_CIVILIZATION_GEDEMO_ZIMBABWE_DESCRIPTION_JFD_CIVILIZATION", "津巴布韦文明"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_NAME", "Mwenemutapa"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_NAME", "穆塔帕之王"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_DESCRIPTION", "Tries to build the widest network of alliances possible, and likes civilizations that do the same. Dislikes civilizations that don't establish networks."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_GEDEMO_MUTOTA_DESCRIPTION", "尝试建立最大水平的同盟网络，喜欢这样做的文明，厌恶不这样做的文明。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MATOPE_MANY_ALLIANCES", "The Leader approves of your alliance-making."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MATOPE_MANY_ALLIANCES", "这位领袖认可你的结盟行为。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MATOPE_FEW_ALLIANCES", "The Leader is unhappy you are in so few alliances."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_MATOPE_FEW_ALLIANCES", "这位领袖因为你同盟太少厌恶你"),
("en_US", "LOC_ABILITY_MUTOTA_NAME", "Mutota's band"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_ABILITY_MUTOTA_NAME", "穆托塔的战团"),
("en_US", "LOC_IMPROVEMENT_GEDEMO_DZIMBABWE_NAME", "Dzimbabwe"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_IMPROVEMENT_GEDEMO_DZIMBABWE_NAME", "津巴布韦石城"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_IMPROVEMENTS_PAGE_IMPROVEMENT_GEDEMO_DZIMBABWE_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "A Dzimbabwe is a walled fort or citadel. It was a place for the local leader to live, and a point of defense in case of city attack. Dzimbabwe is a Shona name that, while the translation varies, can mean houses of stone. The ruins contain numerous stone enclosures with soaring walls as tall as 11 meters (36 feet). They were made without the use of mortar. Some scholars think that the city's rulers secluded themselves in a hilltop area where they could conduct rainmaking ceremonies, while others think that the city's rulers were willing to mix with people from different walks of life. Some scholars also think that the city's rulers didn't have a permanent palace but that when a ruler died the heir ruled from wherever they happened to be living at the time."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_IMPROVEMENTS_PAGE_IMPROVEMENT_GEDEMO_DZIMBABWE_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "津巴布韦石城是一个有墙的堡垒或城堡。它是当地领导人居住的地方，也是城市遭受攻击时的一个防御点。津巴布韦石城是修纳人的名字，虽然翻译不一，但都是石头房子的意思。遗迹中包含大量的石头围墙，墙体高达 11米（36英尺）。它们是在没有使用砂浆的情况下建成的。一些学者认为，该城市的统治者将自己隐居在一个山顶区域，在那里他们可以进行降雨仪式，而另一些学者则认为该城市的统治者愿意与来自不同阶层的人混合。一些学者还认为，该城市的统治者没有永久性的宫殿，但当一个统治者去世时，继承人在他们当时刚好居住的地方进行统治。");

-- Berbers
insert or replace into LocalizedText (Language, Tag, Text) values
("en_US", "LOC_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_NAME", "Dihya"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_NAME", "蒂娅"),
("en_US", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_UA_NAME", "Kahina"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_UA_NAME", "卡希娜"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_CVS_DIHYA_NAME", "Queen of the Berbers"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_CVS_DIHYA_NAME", "柏柏尔女王"),
("en_US", "LOC_AGENDA_CVS_DIHYA_DESCRIPTION", "Likes those who keep their citizens happy and their treasury full. Dislikes those who go to war on her home continent."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_AGENDA_CVS_DIHYA_DESCRIPTION", "喜欢人民快乐财政充裕的文明。不喜欢在她所在大陆发动战争的文明。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_REASON_ANY", "(Your coffers are full and your people are happy.)"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_REASON_ANY", "(你的国库充裕，你的人民很幸福。)"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_CVS_DIHYA_HAPPY", "Dihya is impressed by your fair rule and the strength of your economy"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_CVS_DIHYA_HAPPY", "蒂娅对你的公平统治和你的经济实力印象深刻。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_REASON_ANY", "(You have warred on her home continent.)"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_REASON_ANY", "(你在她的家乡大陆上发动战争。)"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_CVS_DIHYA_UNHAPPY", "Dihya is angered that have you gone to war on her home continent"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_CVS_DIHYA_UNHAPPY", "蒂娅对你在她的家乡大陆上开战感到愤怒。"),
("en_US", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA", "Greetings, Dihya, Queen of the Berbers and protector of Tamazgha. Your people face danger at every turn and require your guidance. The sturdy shields of your warriors shall be your aegis against all invaders, and the deserts and mountains too shall rise up to aid you in your defense even as you draw up water from beneath the inhospitable sands. Go now and guard against your enemies: deny them any quarter and let the perseverance of the Berbers be known far and wide."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA", "向您致敬，蒂娅，柏柏尔人的女王和塔马兹加的保护者。你的人民处处面临危险，需要你的指导。你的战士们的坚固盾牌将成为你抵御所有入侵者的屏障，沙漠和山脉也将起来帮助你防御，即使你从荒凉的沙地下抽出水来。现在就去防备你们的敌人吧：拒绝他们的任何要求，让柏柏尔人的坚忍不拔的精神广为人知。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Welcome to Tamazgha, the land of the Imazighen; I am Dihya, queen of these lands and defender of my people."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "欢迎来到塔马兹加，柏柏尔人的土地。我是蒂娅，这些土地的女王和我的人民的卫士。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Would you care to visit one of our fine cities? I'll have our finest provisions retrieved from the ghorfa in your honor."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "你愿意参观我们美丽的城市吗？我会让人从粮仓取出我们最好的食物，以示敬意。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "A most kind invitation; I accept."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "这真是最友好的邀请，我接受。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "来吧，让我们分享我们的首都的位置。如果商队不知道要去哪里，就无法开始传播财富。"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "来吧，让我们分享我们的首都的位置。如果商队不知道要去哪里，就无法开始传播财富。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_HAPPY", "What is it you would like to discuss?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_HAPPY", "你想讨论的是什么呢？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_UNHAPPY", "Go on..."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_UNHAPPY", "继续吧。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "We shall welcome them with open arms."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "我们将张开双臂欢迎他们。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "I would advise against it. The deserts of Tamazgha do not take kindly to outsiders."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "我建议不要这样做。塔玛兹加的沙漠对外来者并不友好。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Please accept these gifts I have sent to you. My delegates have crossed the desert to bring you hand-made couscous, fine earthenware for cooking tajine, and the finest harissa. Be careuful with that last one - it packs quite a punch!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "请接受我送给你们的这些礼物。我的代表们穿越沙漠，为你们带来了手工制作的古斯米、烹饪尖盖锅烩肉的精美陶器，以及最好的哈里萨辣酱。请小心的食用最后一个——它劲可大了。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "The doors of every kasbah and the markets of every souq are open to you and your people."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "每个城堡的门和每个露天广场的集市都向你和你的人民开放。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Only a fool invites trouble willingly into their own home."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "只有傻瓜才会心甘情愿地把麻烦招进自己的家。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Please allow my people entry into your land; we are excited to see what trade opportunities await within."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "请允许我的人民进入你们的土地，我们很想看看里面有什么贸易机会。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "A close friend is as good as a thousand soldiers; together, no harm shall befall our peoples."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "一个亲密的盟友比千军更有价值，让我们在一起，我们的人民就不会受到伤害。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Unfortunately, it seems you have mistaken my politeness for friendship."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "不幸的是，你似乎把我的礼貌误认为是友谊。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "You have proven yourself to a friend to the Imazighen and, as such, to me as well. Let us formalize our most kind association."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "你已经证明了自己是柏柏尔人的朋友，因此也是我的朋友。让我们正式确定我们最友好的关系。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Outstanding!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "优秀的!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Ah, I understand. A nation must always be on guard."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "啊，我明白了。一个国家必须始终保持警惕。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "In this cruel world, we can only depend on a trusted few to have our best interests at heart. I consider you to be one of those few; let us forge an alliance that will protect us from harm like the shield deflects the iron spear."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "在这个残酷的世界上，我们只能依靠少数值得信赖的人，把我们的最佳利益放在心上。我认为你就是这少数人之一；让我们建立一个联盟，像盾牌抵挡铁矛一样保护我们免受伤害。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "A contented populace and a full treasury are the two keys to prosperity. You guide your people well because you strive for these things."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "一个满足的民众和一个充实的国库是繁荣的两个关键。你能很好地指导你的人民，因为你为这些事情而努力。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "You bring bloodshed to these lands, and I know in time you will cast your bloodthirsty gaze upon Tamazgha. I warn you: Look elsewhere, or face your ruin."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "你给这些土地带来了血腥，我知道到时候你会把你嗜血的目光投向塔玛兹加。我警告你。去别的地方看看吧，否则你将面临灭顶之灾。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Your forces tread close to the boundaries of Tamazgha. Make clear your intentions - my people do not take kindly to uninvited guests."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "你们的军队已经接近了塔玛兹加的边界。明确你们的意图——我的人民对不请自来的客人不怀好意。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "A fair trade enriches both buyer and seller - I accept."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "公平的交易使买方和卖方都得到了好处——我接受。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Only a fool would think this trade fair."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "只有傻瓜才会认为这是个公平交易。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Such big talk from such a lowly creature; you do not frighten me."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "这么低级的人说这么大的话，你可别吓着我。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "You are but a lowly lizard scampering across the hot sands. You should learn your proper place before you are squashed underfoot. (Denounces You)"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "你只是一只卑微的蜥蜴，在炎热的沙地上窜来窜去。在你被压在脚下之前，你应该学会摆正你的位置。(谴责你)"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Tell me, by going to war do you imagine yourself to be like the magnificent eagle, soaring and striking at your enemies? Ignorant fool, you are no more than a little grebe!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "告诉我，通过参战，你是否想象自己像雄伟的老鹰一样，翱翔在空中，向敌人发起冲击？无知的傻瓜，你不过是一只小䴙䴘！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Like the great winds that blow across the desert, we shall scour you from these lands. Prepare yourselves, for a mighty storm is upon you!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "就像吹过沙漠的大风，我们将把你们从这些土地上刮走。准备好了，因为一场强大的风暴正在向你们袭来!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "I accept. With this, peace returns to Tamazgha, and the land itself seems to breathe a sigh of relief."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "我接受。这样一来，塔玛兹加恢复了和平，土地本身似乎也松了一口气。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "You may pillage these lands and murder my fellow Imazighen, but I will never submit to the likes of you!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "你可以掠夺这些土地，谋杀我的柏柏尔同胞，但我绝不会屈服于你这样的人！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "Enough blood has been spilt here. Let us end this strife - for both of our countries' sakes."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "这里的血已经流得够多了。让我们结束这场纷争——为了我们两国的利益。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "And so you see the rumors that I can see the future were false, for surely I would have prophesied this. Yet I have never been surer than when I say that your control of these lands will not last. My people will rise up against you; maybe not tomorrow, maybe not in a hundred years, but eventually... my people will be free once more."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_ANY", "所以你看，关于我能看到未来的传言是错误的，因为我没有预见到这一点。然而，我从未像现在这样确信，你对这些土地的控制不会持久。我的人民会起来反抗你；也许不是明天，也许不是百年，但最终......我的人民将再次获得自由。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_DIHYA_QUOTE", "The land where the stones know you is worth more than the land where the people know you."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_DIHYA_QUOTE", "岁月虽然会流逝，但山川不会遗忘"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_DIHYA_TITLE", "Dihya"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_DIHYA_TITLE", "蒂娅"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_DIHYA_SUBTITLE", "Queen of the Berbers"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_CVS_DIHYA_SUBTITLE", "柏柏尔女王"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_CAPSULE_BODY", "Dihya has many tricks up her sleeves to defend her homeland, which will flourish in the otherwise barren desert."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_CAPSULE_BODY", "蒂娅有很多谋略来保卫她的家园，她的家园将在原本贫瘠的沙漠中蓬勃发展。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_DETAILED_BODY", "Dihya is all about maximizing defensive capabilities. Scorched earth tactics mean that pillagers in her lands will find no quarter, and her units receive a considerable boost to their strength when fightin in Berber lands. The Berber Arer Warriors complement this playstyle as well, but can also go on the offensive. If Dihya settles in a heavily mountainous area, she will be able to leverage her production bonus both for infrastructural and military purposes. Get on her good side by maintaining a healthy economy and a happy populace."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_DETAILED_BODY", "蒂娅能最大化她的防御能力。焦土战术意味着在她的土地上的掠夺者将找不到任何机会，而她的部队在柏柏尔人的土地上作战时，会得到相当大的力量提升。柏柏尔人战士也是这种打法的补充，但也可以发动进攻。如果蒂娅定居在一个多山的地区，她将能够利用她的生产奖励来实现基础设施和军事目的。通过维持一个健康的经济和快乐的人民，获得她的好感。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "Dihya was a Berber warrior-queen known for resisting the Arab invasions of the 7th century. She was a member of the Jarawa tribe, which was part of the Zenata confederacy, located in eastern Algeria. Her Arab opponents knew her as al-Kahina, the soothsayer. They thought she had the power of prophecy and believed her to be a powerful sorceress. According to some historians, Dihya may have had partly Byzantine heritage as well. Little is known of Dihya’s personal life, however. Her faith is a particularly complicated sticking point. The Arabs wrote in their histories that she was Jewish, and indeed the Jarawa tribe is believed to have converted to Judaism at some point, although it is unknown if they later adopted Christianity. Additionally, one historian, al-Maliki, notes that she was accompanied in her travels by an idol, perhaps referring to an icon of the Virgin Mary or a Christian saint. It could also have been an idol of an indigenous Berber deity. Unrelatedly, Dihya may also have had an interest in studying desert birds."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "蒂娅是一位柏柏尔人的女战士，因抵抗7世纪的阿拉伯入侵而闻名。她是贾拉瓦部落的成员，该部落是位于阿尔及利亚东部的泽纳塔联盟的一部分。她的阿拉伯对手将她称为卡希娜，即占卜师。他们认为她有预言的能力，并认为她是一个强大的女巫。根据一些历史学家的说法，蒂娅可能也有部分拜占庭遗产。然而，对蒂娅的个人生活知之甚少。她的信仰是一个特别复杂的症结所在。阿拉伯人在他们的历史中写道，她是犹太人，而且事实上，贾拉瓦部落被认为在某个时候皈依了犹太教，尽管不知道他们后来是否采用了基督教。此外，一位历史学家马利克指出，她在旅行中由一个偶像陪伴，也许指的是圣母玛利亚或基督教圣徒的圣像。它也可能是一个柏柏尔人的本土神像。与此无关的是，蒂娅可能还对研究沙漠鸟类有兴趣。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "Dihya ruled over her kingdom, which stretched from the Aures mountains in the north to the oasis of Ghadames in the south, for 13 years. She came to power in the aftermath of the defeat of another great Berber resistance figure named Kusaila, who had died in 688, and quickly took up the mantle of the fight against the Umayyad invaders. After Hassan ibn Numan conquered the Byzantine Exarchate of Africa, and its capital of Carthage, he moved onto Numidia, where was told that the most powerful monarch in Ifriqiya was the Dihya, the Queen of the Berbers."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "迪西亚统治了她的王国，从北部的奥雷斯山脉到南部的加达米斯绿洲，长达13年。她是在另一位伟大的柏柏尔人抵抗者库赛拉（Kusaila）失败后上台的，库赛拉死于688年，她迅速接过了对抗倭马亚入侵者的衣钵。在哈桑-伊本-努曼征服了拜占庭的非洲军区及其首府迦太基后，他转战努米底亚，在那里听说伊非利基亚最强大的君主是柏柏尔人的女王蒂娅。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_3", "The Berber and Arab armies met near a river in the northern Aures mountains near modern-day Meskiana, Algeria. Diya concealed her armies in the mountains and, at night, moved her army to surround ibn Numan’s troops. She also dispersed her archers among her camel cavalry to hide their true numbers. When the Arabs attacked, they were surprised by showers of arrows that arose from among the Dihya’s camelry. The Berber cavalry then entered the fray, decimating the Arab army. Thus concluded the Battle of Wadi Nini, also known as the Battle of the Camels in memory of Dihya’s successful tactics. The Berbers chased the retreating Arab army all the way to Gabes, expelling them from Ifriqiya. The Berbers took many prisoners, but Dihya freed all of them save a nephew of Hassan ibn Numan, named Khalid ibn Yazid. The battle was so devastating to the Arabs that they named the wadi where the battle took place Nahr al-Bala, or River of Hardship."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_3", "柏柏尔人和阿拉伯人的军队在今阿尔及利亚梅斯基纳附近的奥雷斯山脉北部的一条河边相遇。蒂娅将她的军队隐藏在山中，并在夜间调动军队包围伊本-努曼的部队。她还将她的弓箭手分散在她的骆驼骑兵中，以隐藏他们的真实人数。当阿拉伯人进攻时，他们被从蒂娅的骆驼队中冒出的箭雨吓了一跳。随后，柏柏尔人的骑兵进入战场，消灭了阿拉伯军队。瓦迪-尼尼之战就此结束，为了纪念蒂娅的成功战术，它也被称为骆驼之战。柏柏尔人将撤退的阿拉伯军队一直追到加贝斯，将他们赶出了伊非利基亚。柏柏尔人抓了很多俘虏，但除了哈桑-伊本-努曼的一个侄子，名叫哈立德-伊本-亚齐德，迪海亚释放了所有俘虏。这场战役对阿拉伯人的打击很大，他们把发生战役的瓦迪命名为Nahr al-Bala，即困难之河。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_4", "For the next 4 to 5 years, the Arabs were unable to launch another attack on Ifriqiya and were forced to retreat to Cyrenaica to recover their forces. When they did return, however, their forces were overwhelming. Dihya recognized this and resorted to scorched earth tactics in an attempt to deny the invaders the benefit of their captured lands. This alienated some of her people, however, particularly those who lived amongst the oases. Nevertheless, the invasion continued, and the Arabs captured many cities in modern-day Tunisia, including Gafsa and Gabes. Dihya attempted to block the Arab advance at Tabarka, on the northern Tunisian coast, but after a bitter fight was repulsed. So, Dihya’s forces were pushed back into the Aures mountains."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_4", "在接下来的4到5年里，阿拉伯人无法再对伊非利基亚发动进攻，被迫撤退到昔兰尼加以恢复他们的部队。然而，当他们回来的时候，他们的部队是压倒性的。蒂娅认识到了这一点，并采取了焦土战术，试图不让侵略者从他们占领的土地上获得好处。然而，这疏远了她的一些人，特别是那些生活在绿洲中的人。尽管如此，入侵仍在继续，阿拉伯人占领了现代突尼斯的许多城市，包括加夫萨和加贝斯。迪海亚试图在突尼斯北部海岸的达巴卡阻挡阿拉伯人的进攻，但经过激烈的战斗后被击退了。于是蒂娅的部队被逼退到奥雷斯山区。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_5", "Dihya died not too long after; the exact circumstances surrounding her death are unknown, however. She may have died fighting the Arabs, sword in hand, or may have swallowed poison to avoid capture by the enemy. Ibn Khaldun states that she was captured and decapitated, with her head sent to the Caliph in Damascus, but this is most likely an Arab invention. Whatever her fate, it is believed that Dihya’s sons died alongside her. She was buried in the city of Khenchela and the site of her final defeat was immortalized with the name Bir el Kahina, the Well of Kahina."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_5", "蒂娅在不久之后就死了；然而，围绕她死亡的确切情况却不得而知。她可能是在与阿拉伯人的战斗中死去的，手里拿着剑，也可能是为了避免被敌人抓住而吞下了毒药。伊本-赫勒敦（Ibn Khaldun）说，她被俘后被斩首，头颅被送到大马士革的哈里发那里，但这很可能是阿拉伯人的伪史。不管她的命运如何，据说迪哈的儿子们都和她一起死去。她被埋葬在汉舍莱城，她最后失败的地方被命名为Bir el Kahina，即卡希娜之井，成为不朽之地。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_6", "Dihya remains a prominent figure in Berber cultural consciousness, representing the fighting spirit of the Berber people and their fierce independence. The memory of this great queen, perhaps the only woman to lead the resistance against growing power of the Arab Muslim caliphates, endures even to this very day as a powerful symbol of hope and strength over a millennium after her death."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_CVS_DIHYA_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_6", "蒂娅在柏柏尔文化意识中仍然是一个突出的人物，代表着柏柏尔人民的战斗精神和他们激烈的独立。这位伟大的女王也许是唯一一位领导反抗阿拉伯穆斯林哈里发日益强大的女性，她的记忆甚至在她死后的一千年里仍然作为希望和力量的强大象征而持续存在。");

-- Swahili
insert or replace into LocalizedText (Language, Tag, Text) values
("en_US", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN", "Sultan al-Hassan ibn Sulaiman, yours is an empire of humble fishermen and proud merchants, and through their efforts, your coasts will teem with bustling ports and prosperous cities. Guide them to great things from your palace of Husuni Kubwa, and soon the greatest men of the age shall come to gaze upon the gleaming coral cities of the Swahili, and pay tribute to you; their magnificent sultan."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN", "苏丹哈桑·伊本·苏莱曼，你的帝国是一个由谦卑的渔民和荣耀的商人组成海洋国度。通过他们的努力，你的海岸将充斥着热闹的港口和繁荣的城市。从你的基尔瓦大王宫引导他们做大事，不久，这个时代最伟大的人将会来凝视斯瓦希里人闪闪发光的珊瑚城市，并向你——他们伟岸的苏丹致敬。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "I bid you welcome to Kilwa weary traveler. I am their Sultan al-Hasan, Father of Gifts. Have you come for a gift too?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "我欢迎你来到基尔瓦，疲惫的旅行者。我是他们的苏丹哈桑，礼物之父。你也是为了礼物而来吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "Join me for Friday prayers, I should like to get to show you our Great Mosque."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "和我一起参加星期五的祈祷吧，我想让你看看我们的大清真寺。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "May God bless you for your hospitality."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "你的热情值得神明保佑。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "Kilwa has a splendid palace and a wonderful mosque, all built with coral and decorated with porcelain. Does your capital compare?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "基卢瓦有一座金碧辉煌的宫殿和一座美轮美奂的清真寺，都是用珊瑚建造，用陶瓷装饰的。你们的首都能与之相比吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "Word has reached me from the great men of the world that your cities rival those of mine. Truly impressive."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "世上的伟人告诉我，你们的城市可以与我的城市相媲美。真是令人印象深刻。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "You think to house the greatest minds the world has seen in such pitiable conditions? Do you not think of their comfort?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "你把伟人弃若敝履。你不考虑你国家的福祉与进步吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "A tyrant cannot be bargained with! Very well, swords will suffice for words."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "竖子不足与谋! 我将用剑来代替言辞。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "War is a regrettable disruption to trade, but in this case, it seems necessary."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "遗憾的是，虽然战争会破坏贸易，但是在这种情况下我不得不开战了。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "Excellent, we can get back to more important matters. Commerce, for instance."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "很好，我们可以回到更重要的事务上了。比如说，商业。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "No. This bargain is one I cannot yet accept."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "不，这个交易是我目前不能接受的。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "War is such an unpleasant business, isn't it? Perhaps it is time to pursue peace?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "战争是如此令人不快的事情，不是吗？也许现在是追求和平的时候了？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "May God grant that my people not suffer. Be kinder to them than you were to me."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "愿神明保佑我的人民不受苦难。神对他们比对我更仁慈。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "A friendship between our nations will only bring harmony and prosperity. What say you?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "我们国家之间的友谊只会带来和谐与繁荣。你说呢？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "Good. I do believe this should be quite conducive to trade."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "很好。我相信这应该是相当有利于贸易的。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "A pity."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "遗憾。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "You are a friend to Kilwa, and Kilwa is a friend to you."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "你是基尔瓦的朋友，基尔瓦也是你的朋友。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "It is too early for me to make such a decision."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "做这样的决定还太早。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "I am the Father of Gifts, and I must live up to that reputation. I have sent envoys with halwa for you."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "我是礼物之父，我不会辜负这个声誉。我已经派使者为你们带去了哈瓦，这种点心记得配着咖啡吃，有家的味道。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "They stay in my palace as royal guests. I must say, it is nice to be on the receiving end of a gift for once."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "他们作为客人留在我的宫殿里。我必须说，能有一次接受礼物的机会感觉很好。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "I, unfortunately, cannot entertain guests at the moment, perhaps another time?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "很不幸我现在不能招待客人，也许下次吧？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "You would insult me? I promise you will regret these words."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "你侮辱我？我保证你会后悔说了这些话。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "What does it say that even I cannot stand you? (Denounces You)."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "连我都受不了你，这说明什么呢？(谴责你）。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "An alliance between us should be sure to guarantee our mutual prosperity!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "我们之间的联盟肯定能保证我们的共同繁荣!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "Greetings."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "你好！"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "I don’t think I can agree to this."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "我不认为我可以同意这一点。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "You drive a hard bargain! I accept!"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "你开出的价码很高! 我接受!"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "Will you allow our units to cross through your territory?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "你会允许我们的部队穿越你的领土吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "Yes, you may pass through our lands, provided they remain our lands. I will always accept this bargain over warfare."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "是的，你可以通过我们的土地，只要它们仍然是我们的土地。我永远接受这个比战争更重要的交易。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "I cannot trust your men to keep the peace, thus I must refuse."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "我不能相信你的人能够保持和平，因此我必须拒绝。"),
("en_US", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "I hope your soldiers are enjoying the sights. Unless you have more nefarious intentions?"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_ANY", "我希望你的士兵们正在享受这些风景。你会有更邪恶的意图吗？"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_SUK_AL_HASAN_QUOTE", "When I was established, I revenged my father upon the people of Mafia, fought and overcame them."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_SUK_AL_HASAN_QUOTE", "当我登基后，我为我的父亲向马菲亚岛的人报仇，与他们战斗并战胜了他们。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_SUK_AL_HASAN_TITLE", "Al-Hasan ibn Sulaiman"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_SUK_AL_HASAN_TITLE", "哈桑·伊本·苏莱曼"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_SUK_AL_HASAN_SUBTITLE", "Sultan of Kilwa"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_SUK_AL_HASAN_SUBTITLE", "基尔瓦苏丹"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_CAPSULE_BODY", "Though perhaps not masters of naval warfare, the Swahili excel at thriving on the coast. Al-Hasan's abilities buffs the Swahili's most important district: the Harbor."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_CAPSULE_BODY", "尽管斯瓦希里人也许不是海战的高手，但他们擅长在海岸线上繁荣发展。哈桑的能力增强了斯瓦希里人最重要的区域：港口。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_DETAILED_BODY", "Unlike England, Norway, and Spain, the Swahili have almost no bonuses to enhance their naval might. What they do have is the potential for a strong and versatile economic base that those other naval civs would envy. Build your cities on the coast and keep them compact to maximise the benefit you get from your unique ability and the Pillar Tomb. Under al-Hasan, you won't have to worry about fresh water either: your Harbors can act as an excellent substitute, and give culture to boot! If you're ever short on [ICON_Production] Production in your coastal cities, train or buy some Jahazis and send them where they're needed. The most important thing to remember is to not neglect your navy, or your cities may fall prey to the likes of Norway."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_DETAILED_BODY", "与英格兰、挪威和西班牙不同，斯瓦希里人几乎没有增强其海军实力的加成。他们所拥有的是一个强大而多变的经济基础的潜力，其他海军文明会羡慕不已。把你的城市建在海岸线上，并保持紧凑，以使你从你的独特能力和柱陵中获得最大的利益。在哈桑的领导下，你也不必担心淡水问题：你的港口可以作为一个很好的替代品，并提供文化。如果你的沿海城市缺少 [ICON_Production] 生产力，可以训练或购买一些贾哈兹方舟，然后把它们送到需要的地方。最重要的是不要忽视你的海军，否则你的城市可能会成为海洋强国的猎物。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "Sultan al-Hasan ibn Sulaiman, often referred to as “Abu’l-Mawahib” (“father of gifts”), was the ruler of the city-state of Kilwa, from 1310 until 1333. Much of what we know about al-Hasan and about Kilwa itself comes to us through the writings of Ibn Battuta, an extremely well travelled Muslim scholar."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_1", "苏丹哈桑·伊本·苏莱曼（Sultan al-Hasan ibn Sulaiman），通常被称为“Abu'l-Mawahib”（“礼物之父”），是基尔瓦城邦的统治者，从1310年到1333年。我们对哈桑和基尔瓦本身的了解大多来自伊本·白图泰的著作，他是一位游历甚广的穆斯林学者。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "Ibn Battuta recorded his visit to the city around 1331, and commented favorably on the humility and religion of al-Hasan. Sultan al-Hasan ibn Sulaiman is reported to have have been a generous and intelligent man. He passed several years studying the sciences (ilm) at Mecca, where he became, “erudite and learned.” Ibn Battuata was extemely impressed by the sultan’s generosity, noting that he would sit and dine with beggars, and was very liberal with distributing gifts to all (including Ibn Batutta himself) who came to see him. It is because of this generosity that al-Hasan earned the epithet “Father of Gifts.”"),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_2", "伊本·白图泰记录了他在1331年左右对该城的访问，并对哈桑的谦逊和宗教信仰给予了好评。据报道，苏丹哈桑·伊本·苏莱曼是一个慷慨而聪明的人。他在麦加学习了几年的科学（ilm），在那里他变得“博学多才”。伊本·白图泰对苏丹的慷慨留下了深刻的印象，他指出，他愿意与乞丐坐在一起吃饭，并非常慷慨地将礼物分发给所有来见他的人（包括伊本白图泰巴图塔本人）。正是因为这种慷慨，哈桑赢得了 “礼物之父 ”的美誉。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_3", "Ibn Battuta was also particularly impressed by the planning of the city and believed that it was the reason for Kilwa’s success along the coast. During al-Hasan’s reign, Kilwa saw the construction of the Palace of Husuni Kubwa. The site, built of jagged blocks of coral called coral rag, is now only accessible from a worn staircase carved out of the cliff leading up from the water. Its ruin includes traditional Swahili elements, such as a stepped greeting court bordered by guest rooms for visiting merchants, and elements borrowed from other Islamic palaces, such as an octagonal swimming pool, grand audience court, and a residence with some 100 rooms. But the sultan had overreached in his ambition: The palace was occupied for only a short time before it was abandoned, unfinished."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_3", "伊本·白图泰也对这座城市的规划印象特别深刻，认为这是基尔瓦在沿海地区取得成功的原因。在哈桑统治时期，基尔瓦建造了基尔瓦大王宫。该遗址由参差不齐的珊瑚块建成，现在只能从水面上进入悬崖上凿出的一条破旧的楼梯抵达此处。它的遗迹包括传统的斯瓦希里元素，如一个阶梯式的谒见厅，边上是供来访商人使用的客房，以及从其他伊斯兰宫殿借用的元素，如一个八角形的游泳池、大观众席和一个拥有约100个房间的住宅。但苏丹的野心太大。这座宫殿只被建造了很短的时间就被遗弃了，没有完工。"),
("en_US", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_4", "Also during his reign, the sultan made a significant extension to the Great Mosque of Kilwa, which was made of coral stones—the largest mosque of its kind. He built an extension from the east wall of the northern prayer hall, which wrapped around forming a large open court. A very narrow barrel vaulted corridor, consisting of 30 bays complete with dressed coral panels and supported by coral columns ran directly southward. This extension juts out slightly to the east, creating a wing that deviates from the otherwise orthogonal plan. Within the space where the wall splays, two small irregular rooms were preceded by a small porch containing a tank filled with smooth quartz pebbles, a sandstone foot-rubber and a bench. Behind this small assembly of rooms is a somewhat larger plainly vaulted room. This long room leads into a square room four meters across which carries the great dome. This dome, noted in the Kilwa Chronicle, is thought to be the first true dome on Africa’s east coast. It was supported on squinches and decorated with dressed coral panels. After his visit in 1331, Ibn Battuta remarked on the splendor of the dome, which was, until the nineteenth century, the largest dome on the East African coast."),
("zh_Hans_CN", "LOC_PEDIA_LEADERS_PAGE_LEADER_SUK_AL_HASAN_CHAPTER_HISTORY_PARA_4", "在他的统治期间，苏丹还对基尔瓦大清真寺进行了重大扩建，该清真寺由珊瑚石制成，是同类清真寺中最大的。他从北部祈祷大厅的东墙修建了一个延伸部分，环绕形成了一个大型的开放庭院。一条非常狭窄的桶形拱顶走廊，由30个海湾组成，上面有穿好的珊瑚板，由珊瑚柱支撑，直接向南延伸。这个延伸部分略微向东突出，形成一个偏离正面的侧翼。在墙体开凿出的空间内，两个不规则的小房间前有一个小门廊，里面有一个装满光滑石英卵石的水槽，一个砂岩脚垫和一个长凳。在这个小房间组合的后面是一个有点大的普通拱顶的房间。这个长长的房间通向一个四米宽的方形房间，里面有一个巨大的圆顶。在《基尔瓦纪事》中提到的这个圆顶，被认为是非洲东海岸第一个真正的圆顶。它被支撑在斜面上，并以华丽的珊瑚板装饰。伊本·白图泰在1331年访问后，对该穹顶的辉煌赞不绝口，直到19世纪，它还是东非海岸最大的穹顶。"),
